&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PORTLAND, Ore.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&ndash;&amp;nbsp;The Bureau of Land Management is seeking&amp;nbsp;seasonal&amp;nbsp;volunteer hosts for several recreation sites&amp;nbsp;in Oregon and Washington.&amp;nbsp;Hosts will help connect visitors to public lands during a milestone year as the nation celebrates its 250th anniversary, and the BLM celebrates its 80th anniversary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Campground hosts play&amp;nbsp;an important role&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;visitor&amp;nbsp;experience. They offer information about recreation opportunities, answer questions about the area, and help ensure campgrounds remain clean&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;safe. Light maintenance tasks&mdash;such as tidying restrooms, collecting trash, and keeping signs and information boards up to date&mdash;are part of the daily routine.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;This is a live-in volunteer position, and hosts must provide their own&amp;nbsp;self-contained&amp;nbsp;RV. Volunteers&amp;nbsp;may be eligible to&amp;nbsp;receive a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;daily per&amp;nbsp;diem reimbursement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;while serving on site.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Season lengths and schedules vary by location, with most positions running from late spring through early fall.&amp;nbsp;Some locations can accommodate couples who&amp;nbsp;want&amp;nbsp;to host&amp;nbsp;together and share responsibilities. All&amp;nbsp;volunteer campground&amp;nbsp;hosts must complete a federal background check.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Those interested in learning more or applying can visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Volunteer.gov&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;and search for &ldquo;BLM Oregon&rdquo; or &ldquo;BLM Washington&rdquo; to view current openings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;-BLM-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="OutlineElement Ltr SCXW75858130 BCX8" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Web&amp;quot;, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The BLM manages about 245 million acres of public land&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;primarily in 12 western states, including Alaska, on behalf of the American people. The BLM also administers 700 million acres of sub-surface mineral estate throughout the nation. Our mission is to sustain the health, diversity, and productivity of America&rsquo;s public lands for the use and enjoyment of present and future generations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:9pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, arial, Geneva, Helvetica, Century; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;February 19, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, arial, Geneva, Helvetica, Century; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Media&amp;nbsp;contact:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Jonathan Modie,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="mailto:PHD.Communications@oha.oregon.gov" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;PHD.Communications@oha.oregon.gov&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
