&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;More detailed information&nbsp;regarding&amp;nbsp;the ORCA-CB grant program and grantees can be found at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW141016875 BCX8" href="https://www.oregon.gov/ohcs/rental-housing/housing-development/development-resources/pages/general-housing-account-capacity-building.aspx" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(70, 120, 134); font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Oregon Housing and Community Services : General Housing Account Program &ndash; Capacity Building : Development Resources : State of Oregon&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
